  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Citizen Engagement in Democracy and Governance.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this proposed intervention is to increase citizen participation and strengthen civil society oversight of democratic governance in the DRC. These efforts will ultimately lead to strengthened democratic governance, improved electoral processes for the 2028 elections and beyond, and increased citizen trust in the government, all of which will support a peaceful and stable future for the DRC.</narrative>
  </description>
